            "value" : "De voorspellingen voor dit station staan nog niet op dit apparaat. Canadese stroomvoorspellingen downloaden…"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "As previsões desta estação ainda não estão neste dispositivo. Baixando previsões canadenses de correntes…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This station's predictions aren't on this device yet. Downloading Canadian tidal predictions…" : {
      "comment" : "Station download explanation.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Die Vorhersagen für diese Station sind noch nicht auf diesem Gerät. Kanadische Gezeitenvorhersagen werden geladen…"
          }
        },
        "es-ES" : {
